* HIST - COMMAND HISTORY RSX CONTROL

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* HIST - COMMAND HISTORY RSX CONTROL

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:HIST

Uses the separately installed History RSX. The installed program reports
whether that RSX is active, removed, or absent; it can change its active
state.

This is a private console-history tool, not the HELPC navigation history.
Do not enable shared console history for callers without reviewing whether
previous input or credentials could be disclosed.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
